{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>בלטיהם.</b> An incantation that they recite covertly and secretly. And our Rabbis said: בְּלָטֵיהֶם — the deed of demons; בְּלַהֲטֵיהֶם — the deed of sorcery (Sanhedrin 67)." "<b>And Pharaoh's heart grew strong.</b> To say: By sorcery you do this — 'You bring straw to Afraim,' a city that is all straw; so too, you bring sorcery to Egypt, which is all sorcery."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:01.354696424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}